male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511419008:1":{"text":"――ルウ！お前はなぜ、おれたちにつきまとうんだ！","source_cn":"——露！你为什么一直针对我们？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C6487D69E42C7D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1511419009:0":{"text":"なぜ？あははっ、何か勘違いしているみたいね。","source_cn":"你们？哈哈，我想你搞错了什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43507BCA4346D647","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1511419010:0":{"text":"「あなたたち」じゃなくて、「あなた」よ……かわいい子ヒツジちゃん。","source_cn":"我针对的不是你们，而是你~只有你——可爱的小羊羔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA017FAA6581EA5E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1511419011:0":{"text":"<shk>なぜだ！？</shk>","source_cn":"<shk>为什么？！</shk>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F28E7261B05AF32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1511419012:0":{"text":"あら、言ったでしょ？<style=\"highlight\">あなたは……ここで死ななきゃならない</style>の。","source_cn":"啊，我不是告诉过你了吗？<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x591673ABB5FA2DF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1511419013:0":{"text":"私の命令に従わないから、野蛮な手段を使うしかないのよ。","source_cn":"你不肯听从我，那我也只能使用一些暴力手段了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06C1469E2BCD01C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1511419014:0":{"text":"狙いがおれなら、なぜテイスを殺した！？","source_cn":"既然你的目标是我，为什么要杀泰泽？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD209F75CD5B7064","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1511419015:0":{"text":"そんなゴミクズ、子ヒツジちゃんが気にすることなんてないわ。","source_cn":"小羊羔，何必这么在乎一个废物呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE50D3CC5A0898494","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1511419016:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">猟血祭（りょうけつさい）</style>、この残酷なゲームの勝者は一人だけ……まあ、勝者が出ないこともあるけど。どうせ死ぬんだから、私が一足先に彼を、あなたたちの敬愛する神のもとに送ってあげただけよ。","source_cn":"<style=highlight>猎血节</style...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x966509FA92BE78D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1511419017:0":{"text":"なにを、わけの分からないことを！","source_cn":"一派胡言！<key:dialog5>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x990044872AD5EEF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1511419018:0":{"text":"おれは二人を連れて、猟血祭を勝ち上がるつもりだったんだ！お前がテイスを惑わさなければ……","source_cn":"要不是你蛊惑泰泽，我会带领他们三个人一起赢得猎血节！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A1FDBDE26949E25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1511419019:0":{"text":"あらあら、本当に甘ちゃんなんだから。","source_cn":"哎呀，你还真是天真呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3BB5510F4249C3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1511419020:0":{"text":"まだ分からないの？<style=\"highlight\">猟血祭は、殺し合いの祭り</style>。狩猟の神は、鮮血に潤される大地を眺めるのが何よりも好きなのよ……","source_cn":"难道你还没有看清，<style=highlight>猎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x183ABDE4E3472694","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1511419021:1":{"text":"黙れ！ヤクボルの月を侮辱するんじゃねえ！","source_cn":"——闭嘴！不许污蔑雅库伯尔之月！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54E3F34E0E134F28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1511419022:0":{"text":"ふふふ、本当に、忠実で愚かな信徒だこと。","source_cn":"呵呵，真是忠诚又愚蠢的信徒呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x199CE61DBBF6B66F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1511419023:0":{"text":"私の言葉をよーく考えてみることね。神があなたたちに狩りを命じた途端、森の獣は普段よりも凶暴になり、数も急激に増えたのはなぜ？","source_cn":"